From 7ac083e169a8a7f9f7b12397a448605d4ab7a513 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: X512 <danger_mail@list.ru>
Date: Sun, 3 May 2026 11:49:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] 11.8 patches

[rations: rebased onto wine-11.19. system.c: kept upstream's new <assert.h> include alongside the Haiku OS.h block. signal_x86_64.c: dropped the comment-only //#ifndef/#endif pair around usr1_handler, which upstream rewrote (new !data->teb branch); no functional change. thread.c: also renamed spawn_thread around the OS.h include, since 11.19 adds a static spawn_thread() that clashes with Haiku's.]

[rations: rebased onto wine-11.21. configure.ac: upstream split the combined Wayland
dependency check into one WINE_NOTICE_WITH per dependency (c280fc05bd5); kept the split checks
and dropped the linux/input.h one, as this patch had dropped it from the combined check --
patch 1 supplies the input header winewayland needs. The RenkuOS port builds
--without-wayland, so the winewayland hunks below are not compiled; patch 1 is still required,
because makedep resolves every quoted #include of every module, built or not, and fails
configure ("input-event-codes.h: No such file or directory") without it.]

[rations: for the RenkuOS port, dropped the hunks for drivers it does not build
(--without-wayland --without-x): configure.ac's linux/input.h check for winewayland,
winewayland.drv's wayland_keyboard.c and wayland_pointer.c, and winex11.drv's Makefile.in,
bitblt.c and keyboard.c (for xlibe). Without them, HaikuPorts' "Add Wayland input header"
(X512), which only supplied the header those winewayland hunks included, is not needed and is
dropped too: upstream's #include <linux/input.h> is a system include, which makedep skips when
it cannot find it (tools/makedep.c, "ignore system files we cannot find"), whereas the quoted
"input-event-codes.h" made configure fail. Both remain in HaikuPorts' own port.]
---
 dlls/crypt32/unixlib.c          |   4 ++
 dlls/nsiproxy.sys/ndis.c        |  13 ++++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/file.c          |   7 ++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/loader.c        |   8 +++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/serial.c        |   2 +
 dlls/ntdll/unix/server.c        |   3 +
 dlls/ntdll/unix/signal_x86_64.c | 121 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/socket.c        |  15 ++++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/system.c        |  16 +++++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/thread.c        |  17 +++++
 dlls/ntdll/unix/virtual.c       |  51 ++++++++++++++
 dlls/ws2_32/unixlib.c           |   7 ++
 include/wine/server.h           |   4 +-
 programs/winedbg/winedbg.c      |   3 +
 server/change.c                 |   3 +
 server/fd.c                     |   4 ++
 server/signal.c                 |   6 ++
 server/sock.c                   |  14 ++++
 tools/winegcc/winegcc.c         |   3 +
 19 files changed, 299 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

